WEBVTT

00:03:58.254 --> 00:04:00.920
A courageous woman, her name is Najla Hariri,

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.520
she's a Saudi woman in the city of Jeddah,

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.134
she drove a car and she announced

00:04:05.134 --> 00:04:06.863
but she didn't record a video.

00:04:06.863 --> 00:04:08.723
We needed proof.

00:04:08.723 --> 00:04:11.584
So I drove. I posted a video on YouTube.

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:13.495
And to my surprise,

00:04:13.495 --> 00:04:16.384
it got hundreds of thousands of views the first day.

00:04:16.384 --> 00:04:18.090
What happened next, of course?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.984
I started receiving threats

00:04:19.984 --> 00:04:24.546
to be killed, raped, just to stop this campaign.

00:04:24.546 --> 00:04:28.158
The Saudi authorities remained very quiet.

00:04:28.158 --> 00:04:30.338
That really creeped us out.